Hi Marta,
Near the top of the screenshot it says

checking for "/libpq-fe.h"... no

To me this implies that it cannot find the header files for postgresql, so
I'm guessing the postgresql-devel yum package is needed.

You might also need to install the postgresql libs, so on redhat it might
be something like??? I am an ubuntu user myself and I haven't use Redhat
since about 1998 :-)
yum install postgresql-libs
yum install postgresql-devel

Take care,
Seán



